+Hand a file that lives on this rig to the user's phone.
+
+Call `rig_deliver` with the absolute `path` after you have created or downloaded something the user asked for — a document, slide deck, image, archive, exported data. The Remote app renders it as a download card in the chat thread; the user taps it and the file lands on their phone, where they can open or share it.
+
+Verify the file exists first (the tool checks and fails cleanly if it does not). Deliver the final artifact, not intermediate files. One deliver call per file; if the user asked for several, deliver each.
